        /// Requires a full-access live key; test keys get 403 test_key_restricted. Nothing is stored: the URL
        /// carries the signed settings, so changing it breaks the image. Put it in an &lt;img&gt; of a template
        /// (the visual editor’s timer block does this for you). Each open renders one frame per second for a
        /// minute, then the last frame stays; after end it shows zeros. Renders are shared for 5 seconds, so a
        /// broadcast opened by many recipients at once costs one render.
